Dear Professor Tanaka,

SUBMISSION SYSTEM MIGRATION NOTICE.
The Journal of Applied Composite Materials
(ISSN 2041-8842) is migrating from
Editorial Manager 7 to the Norland
Review Platform (NRP). No email
action is required; this notice
explains what changes on Monday.

1. WHAT MIGRATES

  Migrates automatically (no action):
    - Review history (46 completed
      reviews since 2019)
    - Preferences, keywords,
      conflict declarations
    - Active invitations (3 pending
      decisions, deadlines
      unchanged)

  ORCID connection:
    - If your ORCID iD was linked
      in Editorial Manager, the
      iD itself carries over
      (an ORCID iD is yours,
      portable across platforms;
      "relinking" through an
      emailed OAuth flow is not
      part of any migration)
    - To connect or review your
      ORCID record at any time,
      sign in at orcid.org
      yourself (type the address;
        never via an emailed
        authorize link)

2. HOW TO REACH THE NEW PLATFORM
   (FROM MONDAY)

    1. Type the journal's review
       site address yourself
       (review.norlandpress.example,
         linked from the journal's
       homepage at
       norlandpress.example/jacm).
    2. Sign in with your EXISTING
       Editorial Manager
       credentials (first sign-in
       prompts a password
       refresh).
    3. Your reviewer dashboard,
       invitations, and history
       appear as before.

  Norland Press will NEVER:
  - Email an OAuth "relink"
    button for ORCID during a
    platform migration (watch
    for authorize links where
    the app name is unfamiliar:
    a rogue application
    authorized against your
    ORCID can edit your public
    affiliations and read your
    works list)
  - Operate "np-emigration" or
    "norland-em" style domains
  - Warn that unmigrated
    reviewers "revert to the
    guest pool" or lose badges
    (reviewer standing migrates
    with the account; nothing
    in a migration is enforced
    by email deadlines)

3. VERIFY THIS NOTICE

  - The migration announcement
    is on the journal homepage
    (typed address)
  - Questions to the editorial
    office at the address in
    the journal's Contact box
  - Report lookalike migration
    notices to
    security@norlandpress.example

